Build → CI pipeline in Azure Pipelines compiles code, runs unit tests, builds Docker images.

Test → Automated tests run with Selenium for UI and JUnit for backend.

Release → Pipeline prepares Helm charts and deployment manifests.

Deploy → Microservices deployed to AKS (Azure Kubernetes Service) using Helm.

Operate → Configurations managed with Ansible, secrets stored in Azure Key Vault.

Monitor → Azure Monitor + Grafana dashboards track performance, errors, and customer traffic.

